From: richie-rich90454 <rjian880@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH regenerated on upstream 1.137.0]

Binary payloads are captured with `git diff --binary` so the icon and image
deletions replay correctly; without it `git apply` cannot remove binary files.
See docs/ide/patch-manifest.md for what each patch changes and how it is verified.

---
diff --git a/build/gulpfile.extensions.ts b/build/gulpfile.extensions.ts
